 ### Data structures
 The method operates on the following internal states, which are maintained during the optimization stages: [S1, unofficial]
-*   **RVQ Codebooks:** Three codebooks initialized via residual K-means, each containing 1,024 entries.
-*   **Context Refiner:** A lightweight Multi-Layer Perceptron (MLP) shared across anchors, used to recover features from quantized states.
-*   **Attribute Adapter:** A lightweight MLP shared across anchors, used to refine offsets and scaling.
-*   **Anchor Features:** Vectors of dimension $D_f = 50$.
-*   **Local Offsets:** 10 offsets per anchor.
