+3.  **Attribute Adapter Optimization:** Freeze the Context Refiner and optimize the Attribute Adapter to refine the quantized offsets and scaling based on the recovered features [S1, unofficial].
+4.  **Joint Fine-tuning:** Fix the nearest-neighbor RVQ indices and jointly fine-tune the RVQ codebooks, Context Refiner, and Attribute Adapter using the total objective function $\mathcal{L}$ [S1, unofficial].
 
