 ### Edge cases and pitfalls
-*   **Visible Anchor Set:** The losses $\mathcal{L}_{Os}$ and $\mathcal{L}_{\text{adapter}}$ are averaged only over $\mathcal{A}_{\text{vis}}$ [S1, unofficial]. If no anchors are visible, these terms are undefined or zero; implementation must handle empty sets gracefully by returning zero or skipping the term.
